Subject: [PATCH 218/256] =?UTF-8?q?feat(w8a8):=20contract=20v2=20packed=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?[K,out]=20(c1)=20=E2=80=94=20eliminate=20source=20int8=20transp?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ose?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- runtime_binding v3: int8 region [out,in] -> packed [K,out], frozen
  storage_layout=k_out_rowmajor, fail-closed on v1/v2 schema/payload
- qwen35 graph: drop the per-forward int8 weight transpose (150/186/151/187
  nodes), declare packed int8 parameters [K,out] + scale [out]
- packer: emit packed k_out_rowmajor codes by default (v1 order kept for
  differential/audit); manifest gains storage_shape/codes_layout and
  codes_sha256 covers packed bytes
- weight_map/weight_layout/driver/fixture/audit tooling adapted to packed
  storage; WeightLayout layout_version 1->2
- SVE256 int8 ingestion regression (BufferBinding byte view, negative
  codes, -128 fail-closed); four-backend v1-vs-v2 opcode differential
  (scalar/vector/AVX2/AVX-512/SVE256 + CUDA fake driver)
- no backend kernel/lowering/artifact-payload changes (payload version
  not bumped; stale artifacts rejected via program_digest)

